### Create a new loan
POST http://localhost:8090/api/create?mobileNumber=4354437687

### Fetch loan details by mobile number
GET http://localhost:8090/api/fetch?mobileNumber=4354437687

### Update loan details (put the real loanNumber from the fetch response in update-loan.json)
PUT http://localhost:8090/api/update
Content-Type: application/json

< ./update-loan.json

### Delete loan by mobile number
DELETE http://localhost:8090/api/delete?mobileNumber=4354437687
